      "source_section": "Key Processes (Table 2)",
      "source_text": "Compliance Calling/Hygiene Calling are of 4 types. Questionnaire based information is collected and stored in Excel. This information is transferred to Field Audit & Anti-Fraud team.",
      "source_type": "docx_table"
    },
    {
      "element_id": "bp_customer_care_2",
      "element_name": "Customer Care",
      "source_section": "Key Processes (Table 2)",
      "source_text": "Calls from unregistered numbers have 3 IVR workflows: If the call is for a new loan, the call is transferred to the Sales team. If the call is related to DSA, then the customer is given 2 further opti",
      "source_type": "docx_table"
    },
    {
      "element_id": "bp_escalation_handling_3",
      "element_name": "Escalation Handling",
      "source_section": "Key Processes (Table 2)",
      "source_text": "Escalation matrix has been defined and recorded in the document \u201cV2 Customer care SOP\u201d.",
      "source_type": "docx_table"
    },
    {
      "element_id": "bp_loan_information_ass_4",
      "element_name": "Loan Information Assistance",
      "source_section": "Key Processes (Table 2)",
      "source_text": "Providing customers with information about their loan accounts, including balance, payment due dates, and account status. Ameyo IVR software is integrated with Salesforce for Loan information",
      "source_type": "docx_table"
    },
    {
